  "details": "# Issue:\n\nRight now the float / slider which enables a Phys Bone to be stretched and squished by movement is called `Stretch Motion`. This can be a bit confusing considering that this slider controls both stretch and squish.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nChange the name of the `Stretch Motion` slider / float to `Stretch & Squish Motion` as it better communicates what it's actually doing.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a picture showcasing the issue:",
